{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02515","headline":"七夕赋咏成篇 · 沈叔安","name":"七夕赋咏成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎皎宵月丽秋光，耿耿天津横复长。\n停梭且复留残纬，拂镜及早更新妆。\n彩凤齐驾初成辇，雕鹊填河已作梁。\n虽喜得同今夜枕，还愁重空明日牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈叔安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}